# G8 (graphics): the mouse in the dialogs in graphics. Find opened from its menu, a field, a held button (pressed, raised when the pointer leaves it,
# pressed again, run on release), a check box, the title bar and the space outside (nothing), the Close button; then the Fonts dialog's
# radio buttons and check boxes and its OK; the About box. Every frame's CRC-32 must equal the host's in both graphics modes.
@copy letter.rtf
@open LETTER.RTF
@click 145 9            # Find menu
@click 215 32           # Find...
@click 336 204          # the field
d e a r
@down 140 292           # Find Next held: pressed
@move 2 2               # the pointer leaves it: raised
@move 140 292           # back: pressed again
@up 140 292             # released over it: it runs
@click 132 248          # Match case
@click 320 177          # the title bar: nothing
@click 2 2              # outside the dialog: nothing
@click 236 292          # Close
@click 199 9            # Character menu
@click 263 196          # Fonts...
@click 347 193          # Arial
@click 111 237          # Bold
@click 112 303          # OK
@click 425 9            # Help menu
@click 425 30           # its first item
f10 down down enter     # File > Save
f10 end enter           # File > Exit
